{"data":{"id":9104,"name":"AIOZ Network","symbol":"AIOZ","slug":"aioz-network","category":"coin","description":"## What is AIOZ Network?\n\nAIOZ Network is a blockchain-based platform revolutionizing content distribution through decentralized technology. It leverages a global network of decentralized physical infrastructure networks (DePINs) to enhance web3 storage, AI computation, and streaming services. By utilizing blockchain, AIOZ ensures low transaction fees and high interoperability with Ethereum and Cosmos, making it a versatile choice for developers and users alike.\n\nThe platform supports decentralized applications (dApps) and smart contract languages, enabling a wide range of functionalities. AIOZ Network's recent mainnet launch, compatible with MetaMask, facilitates seamless asset bridging between networks, enhancing user experience and accessibility. The recommended gas price for transactions on its mainnet is 1000000000attoaioz.\n\nAIOZ Network also focuses on live streaming and video on demand, offering a blockchain-based streaming platform that integrates AI technology. This allows for efficient content distribution and tokenomics, rewarding users for sharing computational resources for storing, transcoding, and streaming digital media content. The platform's whitelist program for projects further encourages innovation and participation within the ecosystem.\n\nThe emphasis on decentralized AI computation and web3 storage positions AIOZ Network as a key player in the future of digital media and blockchain technology.\n\n### What is the technology behind AIOZ Network?\n\nThe AIOZ Network stands out as a decentralized platform that integrates content distribution and tokenomics specifically designed for media. At its core, AIOZ Network operates on a blockchain that supports web3 storage, decentralized AI computation, and video streaming. This blockchain is not just a ledger of transactions but a comprehensive infrastructure solution that empowers a faster, more secure, and decentralized future.\n\nOne of the key aspects of the AIOZ Network is its use of a global network of decentralized physical infrastructure networks (DePINs). These DePINs enable users to share their computational resources, which are then utilized for storing, transcoding, and streaming digital media content. This decentralized approach ensures that the network is not reliant on a single point of failure, making it more resilient and robust against potential attacks from bad actors.\n\nThe blockchain technology behind AIOZ Network employs advanced cryptographic techniques to secure transactions and data. Each transaction is verified by multiple nodes in the network, ensuring that no single entity can manipulate the data. This consensus mechanism, often referred to as proof-of-stake or proof-of-work depending on the specific implementation, prevents double-spending and ensures the integrity of the blockchain.\n\nIn addition to its security features, AIOZ Network incorporates tokenomics to incentivize participation and resource sharing. The native cryptocurrency, AIOZ, is used to reward users who contribute their computational resources to the network. This creates a self-sustaining ecosystem where users are motivated to support the network's operations, thereby enhancing its overall efficiency and performance.\n\nFurthermore, AIOZ Network's decentralized AI computation capabilities allow for more efficient processing of complex tasks. By distributing the computational load across multiple nodes, the network can handle large-scale AI applications without the need for centralized data centers. This not only reduces costs but also minimizes the environmental impact associated with traditional data centers.\n\nThe integration of web3 storage within the AIOZ Network ensures that data is stored in a decentralized manner, reducing the risk of data breaches and unauthorized access. This is particularly important for sensitive media content, as it provides an additional layer of security and privacy for users.\n\nAIOZ Network also leverages smart contracts to automate various processes within the network. These self-executing contracts with predefined rules and conditions enable seamless interactions between users and the network, reducing the need for intermediaries and enhancing overall efficiency.\n\nThe combination of these technologies makes AIOZ Network a powerful platform for media distribution and decentralized computation. By leveraging blockchain, decentralized storage, AI computation, and tokenomics, AIOZ Network provides a comprehensive solution that addresses the challenges of traditional centralized systems.\n\n### What are the real-world applications of AIOZ Network?\n\nAIOZ Network (AIOZ) is a decentralized platform that leverages blockchain technology to revolutionize various digital services. One of its primary applications is in the realm of media streaming. By utilizing a global network of nodes, AIOZ enables decentralized video streaming, which can significantly reduce costs and improve streaming quality. This is particularly beneficial for live streaming and video-on-demand services, where traditional centralized servers often struggle with bandwidth and latency issues.\n\nIn addition to media streaming, AIOZ Network is making strides in decentralized AI computation. This involves using the collective computational power of its network to perform complex AI tasks. Such an approach can democratize access to AI resources, making it feasible for smaller entities to engage in AI research and development without the need for expensive infrastructure.\n\nAnother significant application of AIOZ Network is in web3 storage. By decentralizing data storage, AIOZ ensures that data is more secure and less prone to censorship or loss. This decentralized approach also allows users to earn rewards by sharing their unused storage space, creating a more efficient and user-driven storage ecosystem.\n\nAIOZ Network also explores the potential of deep federated learning for autonomous driving. This involves training AI models across decentralized nodes without sharing raw data, enhancing privacy and security. Such technology can be pivotal in advancing autonomous vehicle systems, making them safer and more reliable.\n\nFurthermore, AIOZ is pushing the envelope with DePIN AI, integrating decentralized physical infrastructure networks with artificial intelligence. This combination can lead to innovative solutions in various fields, from smart cities to advanced robotics.\n\nBy integrating blockchain technology with AI, storage, and streaming, AIOZ Network is paving the way for a more decentralized and efficient digital future.\n\n### Who are the founders of AIOZ Network?\n\nAIOZ Network (AIOZ) is a decentralized platform designed for Web3 AI, storage, and streaming. The founder of AIOZ Network is Erman Tjiputra. Erman Tjiputra, with a background in technology and entrepreneurship, has played a significant role in the conceptualization and development of the network. Erman Tjiputra has focused on leveraging a global network of decentralized physical infrastructure networks (DePINs) to create a faster, more secure, and decentralized future for digital media content and AI computation.","dateAdded":"2021-04-02T00:00:00.000Z","actualTimeStart":"2021-04-02T19:00:00.000Z","status":"active","isBn":0,"subStatus":"normal","notice":"","alertType":2,"alertLink":"","latestUpdateTime":"2026-10-19T06:44:00.000Z","watchCount":"159973","watchListRanking":267,"latestAdded":false,"launchPrice":0.015,"tags":[{"slug":"media","name":"Media","category":"INDUSTRY","status":1,"priority":5},{"slug":"platform","name":"Platform","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":5},{"slug":"ai-big-data","name":"AI & Big Data","category":"INDUSTRY","status":1,"priority":1},{"slug":"distributed-computing","name":"Distributed Computing","category":"INDUSTRY","status":1,"priority":2},{"slug":"smart-contracts","na